\f1\fs22 Chip noticed.\
Johnny noticed Chip noticing and settled further into it.\
Dr Quark sat at the end of the conference table with his device propped in front of him, reading through the Gibson data for what was probably the fiftieth time. Chip remained standing.\
Eloise came in, glanced once around the room and sat opposite Johnny.\
\
